    "reviews": "\u201cCyberpulse is a wonderfully fun and chaotic chunk of arcade action, which successfully puts a spin on the twin-stick shooter.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Movies Games and Tech<br><br>\u201cTerrific combat and sensational gameplay that keeps players locked in.\u201d<br>Stack Up<br><br>\u201cThe spiritual successor to Geometry Wars and more. I\u2019m awarding Cyberpulse the 'Most Underrated Game I\u2019ve Ever Played (So Far)' award.\u201d<br>Sl1ppey<br>",
